hcwCAD-KIT
The architectural tools in crates/engine/src/cmd/hcw.rs (layer sets, room types, room label and
area behaviour) are re-implemented in Rust from hcwCAD-KIT, Copyright (c) Holgundi Consulting
Works, MIT License (https://github.com/HolagundiWorks/hcwCAD-KIT). No C# source is included.

Architect Calculator and Pomodoro widget
crates/engine/src/calc.rs is a Rust port of the Architect Calculator Android app
(https://github.com/HolagundiWorks/architect-calculator, by the author of this project).
crates/engine/src/pomodoro.rs follows the behaviour of the Pomodoro clock in the AQC desktop
program (https://github.com/HolagundiWorks/AQC, AGPL-3.0); it was written independently and
contains no AQC source.

AQC bridge
crates/engine/src/cmd/bridge.rs reads and writes the hcw-aqc-bridge version 1 JSON format used by
AQC (https://github.com/HolagundiWorks/AQC). Only the file format is shared; no AQC source is
included.
